Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:16:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Audit log (Activity log)

- Migration 0009: append-only audit_log (no edits or deletes, even by Care
  Africa); database triggers record clinical records (fields only, never
  content), members, team, invitations, settings and modules, services,
  practitioners, products, rewards, sales, claims and appointments; 2FA
  resets; IP and device kept
- App-reported events: sign-ins (once per session), wrong two-step codes,
  recovery codes used, 2FA set up, new recovery codes, password changes,
  opening a member profile, exports
- Settings > Activity log (admins): by day, search, filter by type and
  person, expandable detail, CSV export (itself logged)
- Fixes: member profile crashed when date of birth was missing; Settings
  tabs now wrap
- Tests: 30 new database checks (165 in total)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EwPyWPTXSAWwnbXCzMZAVM
